### approval wording in new backup text
8:A backup set, a restore and a drill report are engineering artefacts. None of them is a business, Finance or IT approval. **Recovery objectives (RPO/RTO) are to agree with Mobily IT**: this guide proposes none. The Compose stack in this repository is **not** a high-availability production deployment. A successful local drill does not show that production is ready for high availability.
